{"unit_id":"zhyunran__dsh-session-bundle#card-zh","repo":"zhyunran/dsh-session-bundle","commit":"19f17fe0dedadcf5189583ae1304e0726b2be2ee","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-bundle 是面向 DSH 的会话归档插件，提供斜杠命令和 agent 工具两种入口。它读取当前会话事件，整理可读的 Markdown 对话、原始 JSONL 日志、附件、显式交付文件和工作区变更，并将内容写成 ZIP 到 Host 本机。可通过配置选择工作区扫描方式、是否包含附件与原始日志，以及输出目录和大小上限。适合需要把一次 DSH 会话及其文件成果一起保存或交接的用户；不需要 API 密钥或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:55-85","lib/bundle.js:82-100","lib/collect.js:243-260"]}
{"unit_id":"zhyunran__dsh-session-bundle#card-en","repo":"zhyunran/dsh-session-bundle","commit":"19f17fe0dedadcf5189583ae1304e0726b2be2ee","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-bundle exports a DSH session as a ZIP through a command or agent tool. It includes a Markdown transcript, event log, attachments, deliverables, and workspace changes, then saves the archive on the Host. The output directory and included content are configurable. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:55-85","lib/bundle.js:82-100","lib/collect.js:243-260"]}
